        },
        {
          "id": "q-by-this-time-tomorrow-2",
          "order": 2,
          "segments": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Where have you been tempted to \"sit still\" instead of taking a step of faith? Is there an area where fear, comfort, or uncertainty has kept you from responding to what God may be asking you to do?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q-by-this-time-tomorrow-3",
          "order": 3,
          "segments": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What is one step of faith God may be inviting you to take this week? It may not feel comfortable, but what would it look like to trust God enough to move forward anyway?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q-by-this-time-tomorrow-4",
          "order": 4,
          "segments": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If you knew God was already at work, what would you do differently this week? How would believing that God can use one act of obedience change the way you approach your current situation?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q-by-this-time-tomorrow-5",
          "order": 5,
          "segments": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Who can you extend hope to this week? Like the 4 lepers who refused to keep the good news to themselves, who can you encourage, serve, or share the hope of Jesus with this week?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
